        },
        {
          "text": "Hakurua Ënooköë akagamba iga, “Tiga töteeme ömöntö gutuubho yeitö na kögësösa gëitö. Nabho bhabhe na ichinguru cha köbhaaha ichinsui chi inyancha, ibhinyunyi na ichitiinyi chonsui, ichitugo na ichitiinyi cha ibhara hamui na ichitiinyi chino chikuing'uura hansë.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.1.26",
